  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald", "title": "Dependency rule",
      "items": [
        "PlaceAndSpotUseCase depends only on the PersistenceRepository port and domain types",
        "di-container is the only module that picks a concrete adapter (USE_CONVEX=1 → ConvexAdapter)",
        "Adapters are built per request so the Convex HTTP client runs with the caller's auth token"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber", "title": "Where the boundaries leak",
      "items": [
        "tags.remote.ts calls Convex directly, skipping the use case and port",
        "ConvexAdapter (and the settings page) import transformResultToPlace from the Appwrite DTO folder",
        "Port methods are typed any; getSpotByPlaceId actually receives a spot row id",
        "PlaceRepository, SpotRepository, and the local_dev InMemoryAdapter are defined but never wired"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose", "title": "Authorization",
      "items": [
        "Remote handlers throw 401 when hooks.server left locals.user empty",
        "Convex spot and tag functions call requireUserId (Better Auth identity) and assertUser on the userId argument",
        "Spot reads, updates, and deletes also check spot.userId before touching the row"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate", "title": "Not drawn: uncommitted work",
      "items": [
        "savedLocations: Location domain, SavedLocationRepository port, Convex adapter, remote handlers, table + functions",
        "Wired through getSavedLocationRepository() in di-container, Convex-only with no use case"
      ]
    }
  ]
